claude.preview:
Adds a status line and two hooks to ~/.claude/settings.json so Agent Tree sees Claude plan limits and live activity.

{
  "statusLine": {"type": "command", "command": "PYTHONPATH=\"/Applications/Agent Tree.app/Contents/Resources/app\" \"/Applications/Agent Tree.app/Contents/Resources/python/bin/python3\" -m agent_tree.statusline"}
}
